{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28349","headline":"洛中监察病假满送韦楚老拾遗归朝 · 杜牧","name":"洛中监察病假满送韦楚老拾遗归朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛桥风暖细翻衣，春引仙官去玉墀。\n独鹤初冲太虚日，九牛新落一毛时。\n行开教化期君是，卧病神只祷我知。\n十载丈夫堪耻处，朱云犹掉直言旗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}